  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Greg Hamer wrote:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "...",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "I have tried unsuccessfully to run the Example SOAP Client (as documented",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "here:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Example+SOAP+Client"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Example+SOAP+Client",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ")",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Can anyone confirm for me that the \"Example SOAP Client\" can run",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "successfully against  a \"Quick Install\" installation?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "One error that I am getting is running compile-demo-soapclient.bat.  That",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "is:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "%FEDORA_HOME%\\client\\demo\\soapclient>compile-demo-soapclient.bat",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The error returned is:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "C:\\apps\\Fedora\\client\\demo\\soapclient\\DemoSOAPClient.java:243: cannot find",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "symbol",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "symbol : variable FEDORA_DEFAULT_CONTEXT",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "location: interface fedora.common.Constants",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "String context = Constants.FEDORA_DEFAULT_CONTEXT;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "^1 error",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Finished compile of demo soap client.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Looking at Interface fedora.common.Constants I see no property",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FEDORA_DEFAULT_CONTEXT.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I do, however, see FEDORA_DEFAULT_APP_CONTEXT.  Might this be an error in",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the class DemoSOAPClient.java?  If yes, should I add this as an issue in the",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Tracker?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Docs here for Interface fedora.common.Constants:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://fedora-commons.org/documentation/3.2/javadocs/fedora/common/Constants.html"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://fedora-commons.org/documentation/3.2/javadocs/fedora/common/Constants.html",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
